	end;
}

harboro1,93,201,1	script	Roland Burts#rockwn17	4_M_ILYA,{
	mes "[Roland Burts]";
	mes "Our village is protected by its own group of vigilantes.";
	mes "They keep guard over it under Sheriff Warp's command.";
	next;
	emotion ET_KEK;
	mes "[Roland Burts]";
	mes "Our biggest threat is undoubtedly the Buffalo Bandits, but we also have problems with some wild animals.";
	mes "And under the village, there's?*Shudder* let's not go there.";
	close;
}

harboro1,98,211,3	script	Loretta#rockwn08	4_F_ACOLYTE,5,5,{
	emotion ET_THROB;
	mes "[Loretta]";
	mes "Welcome to the city of freedom, Rock Ridge. Odin is with you wherever you go!";
	mes "Come to us if you want to hear the god's words.";
	next;
	mes "[Loretta]";
	mes "We don't need a chapel. Odin doesn't come to buildings, he comes to our hearts.";
	mes "Let's pray to him and show him our gratitude.";
	next;
	emotion ET_KEK, getnpcid(0, "Dolores#rockwn09");
	npctalk "I wish I could have a glass of cool lemonade somewhere under a nice shade.", "Dolores#rockwn09", bc_self;
	mes "[Dolores]";
	mes "Sister Loretta, my legs hurt. *Whine*";
	mes "He may not come to buildings, but I want to go sit in one.";
	next;
	mes "[Dolores]";
	mes "Ah, that's it, Brother Maurice!";
	next;
	mes "[Loretta]";
	mes "...Sigh. When the last ship of the day enters the dock, I'll buy you lemonade, limeade, whatever you want.";
	mes "So for now, act like the god's servant that you are.";
	next;
	emotion ET_BIGTHROB, getnpcid(0, "Dolores#rockwn09");
	emotion ET_BIGTHROB, getnpcid(0, "Maurice#rockwn10");
	npctalk "We believe in him!", "Dolores#rockwn09", bc_self;
	npctalk "We believe in him!", "Maurice#rockwn10", bc_self;
	mes "[Maurice]";
	mes "Lemonade! I mean, the god is with you!";
	close;

OnTouch:
	npctalk "Odin", "", bc_self;;
	npctalk "Is", "Dolores#rockwn09", bc_self;
	npctalk "With you.", "Maurice#rockwn10", bc_self;
	end;
}

harboro1,100,211,3	script	Dolores#rockwn09	1_F_PRIEST,{
	mes "[Dolores]";
	mes "I agree that our heart is our chapel.";
	mes "But a god can come to cozy bedrooms and a nice-smelling kitchen. We don't have to stand all day in windy ports.";
	next;
	mes "[Loretta]";
	mes "If someone else hears you, they'd think you weren't fed or allowed to sleep for days";
	mes "when, in fact, you wake up later than the rest of us, every day.";
	next;
	emotion ET_PROFUSELY_SWEAT;
	mes "[Dolores]";
	mes "Wh-what can I do? The god visits me in my dreams.";
	mes "I'm not trying to wake up late!";
	close;
}

harboro1,101,210,3	script	Maurice#rockwn10	1_M_PASTOR,{
	mes "[Maurice]";
	mes "As I get older, it's getting more difficult to stand outside all day, spreading his words.";
	mes "But I'm as resolved to complete my mission as I was the first day I arrived here.";
	next;
	emotion ET_DELIGHT;
	mes "[Maurice]";
	mes "I'm not going to let my physical exhaustion get in the way.";
	mes "I'll use every ounce of energy in me to spread his teachings to the people of this new land!";
	close;
}

harboro1,94,237,3	script	Cordell#rockn01	4_M_MAYOR,{
	mes "[Cordell]";
	mes "I feel happy just by looking at the train station. It's the symbol of our village, you know.";
	next;
	mes "[Cordell]";
	mes "The mine was pretty far from the village, so transporting ores was a big problem in the beginning.";
	next;
	mes "[Cordell]";
	mes "The actual development of Rock Ridge began after the train system was finally introduced.";
	mes "Okay, that also aggravated the problem with the Buffalo Bandits, but there's always a dark side to everything.";
	next;
	emotion ET_BIGTHROB;
	mes "[Cordell]";
	mes "But we the people of Rock Ridge are not here to give in, we're here to conquer!";
	close;
}

harboro1,74,259,3	script	Eloise McCurdy#rockn14	4_F_GUNSLINGER,{
	mes "[Eloise McCurdy]";
	mes "I pride myself in protecting cargo here.";
	mes "My job is to protect it against rain, wind, and of course thieves.";
	next;
	emotion ET_CRY;
	mes "[Eloise McCurdy]";
	mes "Recently though... Hmpf, my pride has been crushed by those damnable Buffalo Bandits.";
	close;
}

harboro1,130,237,3	script	Loading Dock Foreman#ro	4_M_05,{
	mes "[Loading Dock Foreman]";
	mes "The train brings ores from the mine, and brings supplies for the miners from this dock.";
	next;
	mes "[Loading Dock Foreman]";
	mes "That's why this place is always busy. A delay here causes a delay everywhere else in Rock Ridge.";
	next;
	npctalk "I'd be motivated to work harder if you raise my salary.", "Jader#rockn11", bc_self;
	npctalk "Hah, hah, hah! Father's power!", "Rosco Richie#rockn12", bc_self;
	npctalk "How did I end up here?", "Portnias#rockn13", bc_self;
	mes "[Loading Dock Foreman]";
	mes "Stop whining like wimps. Be proud to be part of the team and work harder!";
	close;
}

harboro1,126,236,7	script	Jader#rockn11	4_M_SITDOWN,{
	mes "[Jader]";
	mes "Ah, I can't move. I'm aching all over.";
	mes "It doesn't matter whether or not the train comes often. We're always busy.";
	next;
	mes "[Loading Dock Foreman]";
	mes "Hmpf, you're not working hard enough. Tsk, tsk.";
	mes "You should be happy you have a job while many others don't!";
	next;
	emotion ET_OHNO;
	npctalk "I'm tired, and it's not just physical fatigue. *Mumble Mumble*", "", bc_self;
	mes "[Jader]";
	mes "*Gasp* H-how long have you been standing there? O-of course, I'm happy to have a job!";
	mes "I-I love working at this loading dock. It's the best job I've ever had!";
	close;
}

harboro1,128,233,7	script	Rosco Richie#rockn12	4_M_NOV_HUNT,{
	mes "[Rosco Richie]";
	mes "Now that there are more people in the village, there are fewer jobs available. I'm glad I have a job that pays enough to feed my family.";
	next;
	npctalk "Edith! Daddy is working hard for you!", "", bc_self;
	mes "[Rosco Richie]";
	mes "Hah, hah! I can do this for my daughter!";
	close;
}

harboro1,130,232,7	script	Portnias#rockn13	4_CAT_SAILOR2,{
	mes "[Portnias]";
	mes "I came here because I heard I could become rich quickly, nya.";
	mes "I got on a ship to Rock Ridge as soon as I got off the ship from Pa-sta.";
	next;
	mes "[Portnias]";
	mes "Now, I don't care about money anymore. I just want to rest. Nya...";
	mes "I've been moving cargo every day since I came here, and my back is killing me. *Mewl*";
	next;
	emotion ET_OTL;
	mes "[Portnias]";
	mes "At this rate, I'd spend all the Zeny I've earned on paying hospital bills. *Mewl*";
	close;
}

harboro1,144,262,7	script	Scrap Metal Collector#s1	4_M_CAVE1,{
	mes "[Scrap Metal Collector]";
	mes "I want to go home. We're never going to make a lot of money here.";
	next;
	mes "[Scrap Metal Collector]";
	mes "No. We just have to stay strong until this is over. There'll be an opportunity for us afterward.";
	next;
	mes "[Scrap Metal Collector]";
	mes "But this is too much to handle. I don't think I can do this anymore.";
	next;
	mes "[Scrap Metal Collector]";
	mes "Come on, let's be patient for a little longer.";
	next;
	mes "[Scrap Metal Collector]";
	mes "Sigh... I miss my mom.";
	close;
}

harboro1,146,264,3	script	Scrap Metal Collector#s2	4_M_HUBOY,{
	mes "[Scrap Metal Collector]";
	mes "Why isn't there any metal here? Some must have dropped when the train was attacked.";
	next;
	mes "[Scrap Metal Collector]";
	mes "If there was, someone else has to have found it by now.";
	next;
	mes "[Scrap Metal Collector]";
	mes "Sigh, then there's nothing here we could sell. Where should we go now?";
	next;
	mes "[Scrap Metal Collector]";
	mes "Maybe we should go back to the mainland.";
	next;
	mes "[Scrap Metal Collector]";
	mes "What? No! I don't want to be a liar! We told our family we'd be back with loads of money.";
	close;
}

harboro1,182,241,5	script	Stray Dog#srdg02	4_DOG01,{
	emotion ET_SEXY;
	npctalk "I hope they'd leave some food for me.", "", bc_self;
	end;
}

harboro1,183,241,5	script	Stray Dog#srdg01	4_DOG01,{
	emotion ET_SEXY;
	npctalk "I'd love to have a piece of that meat.", "", bc_self;
	end;
}

harboro1,187,236,3	script	Customer#srdg01	4_TOWER_04,{
	mes "[Customer]";
	mes "There aren't many people in this restaurant.";
	next;
	emotion ET_FRET, getnpcid(0, "Customer#srdg02");
	mes "[Customer]";
	mes "Who would want to eat such terrible food?";
	next;
	mes "[Customer]";
	mes "Oh, do you know where the best eatery in this place is?";
	next;
	emotion ET_QUESTION, getnpcid(0, "Customer#srdg02");
	mes "[Customer]";
	mes "Where?";
	next;
	mes "[Customer]";
	mes "The sheriff's office. Those in the underground jail are fed three times a day, and the food is so great that some people actually commit a misdemeanor for it.";
	next;
	mes "[Customer]";
	mes "Does that make sense to you? I don't believe there's prison food worth committing a crime for.";
	close;
}

harboro1,182,236,5	script	Customer#srdg02	4_TOWER_02,{
	mes "[Customer]";
	mes "Why are they staring at us?";
	next;
	mes "[Customer]";
	mes "They're begging.";
	next;
	emotion ET_SPARK, getnpcid(0, "Stray Dog#srdg01");
	emotion ET_SPARK, getnpcid(0, "Stray Dog#srdg02");
	mes "[Customer]";
	mes "Ugh, their staring eyes are making me feel too uncomfortable to eat.";
	close;
}

harboro1,231,251,4	script	Merchant's Chest	4_TREASURE_BOX,{
	npctalk "Exotic Merchant: Hudin's treasure chest! Don't touch it. Thank you!", "Exotic Merchant";
	end;
}

harboro1,229,256,7	script	Charlotte	4_DST_CAMEL,{
	npctalk "*Shriek*";
	sleep 1000;
	npctalk "Exotic Merchant: What's wrong, Charlotte?", "Exotic Merchant";
	end;
}

harboro1,192,262,7	duplicate(dummy_npc)	Bulk Trader's Camel#1	4_DST_CAMEL
harboro1,197,262,7	duplicate(dummy_npc)	Bulk Trader's Camel#2	4_DST_CAMEL
harboro1,210,262,7	duplicate(dummy_npc)	Bulk Trader's Camel#7	4_DST_CAMEL
harboro1,216,262,7	duplicate(dummy_npc)	Bulk Trader's Camel#8	4_DST_CAMEL
harboro1,223,261,1	duplicate(dummy_npc)	Bulk Trader's Camel#9	4_DST_CAMEL
harboro1,225,257,6	duplicate(dummy_npc)	Bulk Trader's Camel#10	4_DST_CAMEL
harboro1,227,263,1	duplicate(dummy_npc)	Bulk Trader's Camel#11	4_DST_CAMEL
harboro1,229,258,6	duplicate(dummy_npc)	Bulk Trader's Camel#12	4_DST_CAMEL
harboro1,234,259,3	duplicate(dummy_npc)	Bulk Trader's Camel#13	4_DST_CAMEL
harboro1,236,252,6	duplicate(dummy_npc)	Bulk Trader's Camel#14	4_DST_CAMEL
harboro1,237,256,3	duplicate(dummy_npc)	Bulk Trader's Camel#15	4_DST_CAMEL
harboro1,238,258,3	duplicate(dummy_npc)	Bulk Trader's Camel#16	4_DST_CAMEL

harboro1,226,255,3	script	Bulk Trader's Camel#3	4_DST_CAMEL,{
	mes "[Camel]";
	mes "Ga-a-ah.";
	close;
}

harboro1,227,260,3	script	Bulk Trader's Camel#4	4_DST_CAMEL,{
	mes "[Camel]";
	mes "*Snort*";
	close;
}
harboro1,227,260,3	duplicate(Bulk Trader's Camel#4)	Bulk Trader's Camel#6	4_DST_CAMEL

harboro1,232,258,6	script	Bulk Trader's Camel#5	4_DST_CAMEL,{
	mes "[Camel]";
	mes "Why do you keep poking at me?";
	next;
	mes "[Camel]";
	mes "...Oops.";
	mes "Forget you heard me.";
	next;
	mes "[Camel]";
	mes "Ga-a-a-ah.";
	close;
}

harboro1,210,219,5	script	Priest#srdg01	4_M_MINISTER,{
	setpcblock PCBLOCK_NPC, true;
	npctalk "Are you anguished or sad? Let me help you.", "", bc_self;
	sleep2 1500;
	npctalk "Every one of us is born to be loved.", "", bc_self;
	setpcblock PCBLOCK_NPC, false;
	end;
}

harboro1,229,212,7	script	Herman Farland#rockn19	4_M_TWTEAMAN,{
	mes "[Herman Farland]";
	mes "Ah, yes, this is the sheriff's office. Do you have to wait in line, you ask?";
	next;
	mes "[Herman Farland]";
	mes "Mm, you're an adventurer, right? Then just move past that door and go straight ahead.";
	next;
	mes "[Herman Farland]";
	mes "You're here to help the Sheriff, right? We're here to ask him for help, so I understand you have to see him before the rest of us.";
	next;
	npctalk "I understand. Aww, my legs!", "", bc_self;
	mes "[Herman Farland]";
	mes "Never mind me. I completely understand. Aww, I've been standing on my feet for so long, I can barely move my legs!";
	close;
}

harboro1,231,212,7	script	Edel Peppina#rockn16	4_F_CAPEGIRL,{
	mes "[Edel Peppina]";
	mes "The sheriff's office is understaffed. I've been waiting in line all day, and the line is as long as it was when I first arrived. I've been hearing strange noises from my basement, and I really need someone to come and check them.";
	next;
	mes "[Edel Peppina]";
	mes "Our sheriff doesn't have legal authority, but still his office is the only place that we could turn to for this kind of thing.";
	next;
	mes "[Edel Peppina]";
	mes "I hope things in the village will settle soon, starting with this line.";
	close;
}

harboro1,233,215,3	script	Wilfred Sagan#rockn15	4_M_SITDOWN,{
	mes "[Wilfred Sagan]";
	mes "The sheriff has been so busy dealing with the Buffalo Bandits that he doesn't have time for anything else. I've been here waiting for him for hours.";
	close;
}

harboro1,168,216,3	script	Hilliard#rockn09	4_TOWER_12,{
	mes "[Hilliard]";
	mes "Many people in the village are jobless, and all available jobs are given to adventurers.";
	next;
	npctalk "This is why it's important to be in the right place at the right time.", "", bc_self;
	mes "[Hilliard]";
	mes "The only thing that thrives because of this influx of adventurers is the inn.";
	mes "Maybe I should've opened an inn myself.";
	close;
}

harboro1,156,215,5	script	Innkeeper#rockridge	1_ETC_01,{
	mes "[Innkeeper]";
	mes "Welcome to the Lazy Owl's Inn.";
	next;
	mes "[Innkeeper]";
	mes "Looking for a place to stay? You came to the right place!";
	mes "Would you like a room? It's 5,000 Zeny.";
	next;
	switch( select( "Save.", "Get a room at 5,000 Zeny.", "Quit." ) ) {
	case 1:
		mes "[Innkeeper]";
		mes "Saved. Please come again.";
		savepoint "harboro1",156,211,2,2;
		close;
	case 2:
		if (Zeny < 5000) {
			mes "[Innkeeper]";
			mes "I'm sorry, but it's 5,000 Zeny to get a room.";
			mes "If you don't have enough money, then I can't let you stay.";
			close;
		}
		mes "[Innkeeper]";
		mes "Enjoy your stay at the Lazy Owl's.";
		close2;
		Zeny = Zeny - 5000;
		percentheal 100,100;
		warp "harboro1",157,210;
		end;
	case 3:
		mes "[Innkeeper]";
		mes "Please come again.";
		close;
	}
}

harboro1,228,170,3	script	Wanderer Doram#rkrgtwn	4_DR_STELO,5,5,{
	mes "[Wanderer Doram]";
	mes "Boohoo! Where the hell is the sheriff's office? My money! Moneeeyyy!";
	next;
	mes "[Wanderer Doram]";
	mes "Everyone said Rock Ridge is the land of opportunity! Why didn't anyone tell me about the scary Buffalo Bandits?";
	next;
	mes "[Wanderer Doram]";
	mes "*Hiccups* They robbed me clean. I don't even have enough money left to have a glass of Kahluna Milk.";
	emotion ET_CRY;
	close;

OnTouch:
	npctalk "Wanderer Doram: Which way is east for the gods' sake?!", "", bc_self;
	end;
}

harboro1,130,158,3	script	Akuha#rockn19	4_M_CACTUSCHILD,5,5,{
	mes "[Akuha]";
	mes "Grandpa said we shouldn't follow strangers, or they'd pluck all our thorns. What if he was telling me the truth?";
	next;
	emotion ET_CRY;
	mes "[Akuha]";
	mes "Boohoo! Grandma! Boohoo!";
	next;
	mes "[Nahari]";
	mes "Don't worry. Your thorns are so sharp, no one would dare touch them.";
	mes "Do I still have the flower on my head?";
	next;
	mes "[Akuha]";
	mes "*Sniffle* Yes, it's as pretty as the last time I checked.";
	next;
	mes "[Nahari]";
	mes "Then we're all right. Let's just keep moving, and we'll meet Grandma soon.";
	mes "Let's check over there.";
	next;
	emotion ET_KEK;
	mes "[Akuha]";
	mes "I can't lose all my thorns and have a smooth face. I'll be so ashamed that I'd want to bury myself in the ground.";
	close;

OnTouch:
	npctalk "Grandma... Grandma... Boohoo!", "", bc_self;
	end;
}

harboro1,132,157,3	script	Nahari#rockn19	4_F_CACTUSCHILD2,{
	mes "[Nahari]";
	mes "This place is amazing. Look at these big wooden houses.";
	mes "There are trees growing on the sea, and they all look alike.";
	next;
	mes "[Akuha]";
	mes "*Whine* Nahari, Grandma is not going to be happy with us.";
	mes "Let's go back before she gets worried.";
	next;
	mes "[Nahari]";
	mes "But we don't even know where we are.";
	mes "Let's look around for a little longer. Look, there are a lot of strangers over there!";
	next;
	emotion ET_CRY, getnpcid(0, "Akuha#rockn19");
	mes "[Akuha]";
	mes "What if we can't go back home?";
	close;
}

harboro1,99,127,7	script	Kid#srdg01	4_KID01,{
	npctalk "Hey, did you guys fight?", "", bc_self;
	end;
}

harboro1,96,130,3	duplicate(dummy_npc)	Thunder#srdg01	4_DONKEY
harboro1,104,130,5	duplicate(dummy_npc)	Lightning#srdg01	4_DONKEY
harboro1,102,133,7	duplicate(dummy_npc)	Speed Racer 2#srdg01	4_DONKEY
harboro1,104,132,5	duplicate(dummy_npc)	Speed Racer 1#srdg01	4_DONKEY


harboro1,174,125,3	script	Villager#srdg01	1_M_INNKEEPER,{
	npctalk "It's pretty windy today. I'd better keep all the doors and windows closed.", "", bc_self;
	end;
}

harboro1,184,123,5	script	Traveler#srdg02_1	4_M_SIT_NOVICE,{
	mes "[Traveler]";
	mes "Maybe we should explore beyond the mine, and go deep as far as we can.";
	next;
	mes "[Traveler]";
	mes "What if it's too dangerous? I said we should take a detour and go someplace else.";
	next;
	mes "[Traveler]";
	mes "Or we could become the pathfinders of an unknown world!";
	next;
	mes "[Traveler]";
	mes "No. The east side is overrun with the Buffalo Bandits. We should wait until the situation with them is resolved.";
	next;
	mes "[Traveler]";
	mes "Those darn Buffalo Bandits!";
	close;
}

harboro1,188,123,3	script	Traveler#srdg02_2	4_M_SITDOWN,{
	mes "[Traveler]";
	mes "I've decided! I'm going to join the Vigilantes!";
	next;
	mes "[Traveler]";
	mes "Are you sure they'll let you in?";
	next;
	mes "[Traveler]";
	mes "I don't know, but I'm tired of twiddling my thumbs. This can't be the end of our journey!";
	close;
